[{:db/id -1 :doc/id "business-openrouter-provider-company-contact-20260908" :doc/title "Owner-confirmed company contact and address roles" :doc/as-of "2026-09-08" :source/dataset "business" :doc/body "## Company contact supplied by owner — 2026-09-08\nCompany-account name: AWAI Network LLC. Legal name on formation certificate: AWAI Network, L.L.C. Entity type: Delaware LLC. Formation date July 20, 2026; Delaware file number 10704996. The owner-supplied EIN matches the previously inspected IRS assignment fax; its value remains excluded from repository text and public application narrative.\nCompany representative: Kawasaki Jun (owner-confirmed role). Company telephone: +81 80 4280 1991, normalized +818042801991. Do not infer a separate billing contact or signing mandate solely from this field.\nCompany address, transcribed as supplied: postal code 150-0001; Tokyo; Shibuya; 2-2-39; Japan. Do not invent an omitted town/street or building name, or replace this company address with the registered office.\nDelaware registered office remains 131 Continental Dr, Suite 305, Newark, DE 19713, United States, as supported by the formation certificate. The owner previously designated this same Newark address for customer support; retain it as the support address until changed. Keep company address, registered office, support address and compute/data-processing location as distinct fields.\nThis resolves the previously missing company representative, company telephone and company-address information through owner confirmation. It is not independent phone/address verification and does not turn the IRS assignment fax into CP575/147C. Billing email/contact designation, OpenRouter payment mechanism and applicable Modal agreement remain open. No account settings or public legal pages were changed, and no application was submitted.\n"}]
